<tr valign="top" height="300" >
<td tEditID="c1r2" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r2" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<font face="arial" style=""><font color="#666666"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Estimado Equipo </span>de Operaciones Impak, <span style="font-size: 12pt;">se ha agregado a este Shipment&nbsp;{!Shipment__c.Name} un nuevo cargo por Demora</span><span style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">.</span></font></font><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font color="#666666"></font><br></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font color="#666666"></font><br></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font color="#666666"><font face="arial" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Estatus actual:&nbsp;</span></font><font face="arial"><b>{!Shipment__c.Shipment_Status_Plann__c}</b></font></font><br></div><div style=""><font face="arial"><font color="#666666"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><b>Shipment</b>:</span><b>{!Shipment__c.Name}</b></font></font></div></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font color="#666666"><span style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><b>Cliente</b>:</span><font face="arial">{!Shipment__c.Account_for__c}</font></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><font color="#666666"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><b>Ruta</b>:</span>{!Shipment__c.Route__c}</font></font></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><font color="#666666"><b>Proveedor:</b>&nbsp;{!Shipment__c.Carrier__c}</font></font></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><font color="#666666"><b>FN - Operador</b>:&nbsp;{!Shipment__c.National_Operator__c}</font></font></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><font color="#666666"><b>FN - Vehiculo:</b>&nbsp;{!Shipment__c.Vehicle__c}</font></font></div><div style=""><font color="#666666"><font face="arial" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><b>Ejecutivo de Operaciones:&nbsp;</b></font><font face="arial">{!Shipment__c.Operation_Executive__c}</font></font></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><font color="#666666"></font><br></font></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font color="#666666"></font><br></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font color="#666666"></font><br></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font color="#666666"></font><br></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font color="#666666"><font face="arial" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><b>Comentarios:</b>&nbsp;</font><font face="arial">{!Shipment__c.Status_Observations__c}</font></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: medium;">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial" style=""><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div></div>]]></td>
</tr>
